WEBVTT

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:11.080
Isn't this enough, as long as you're happy?

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:13.080
No... It's still no good.

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:17.160
I still don't know what kind of pitfalls there are in life.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.620
Jeez. Just give it a little rest!

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.910
Why are you so negative?

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:25.080
You should know, Ezomichi, about my dark period...

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:28.200
No matter the person, if they got rejected like tha-

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.410
Hey!

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:32.120
You're so whiny and annoying!

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:35.660
Are you gonna spend your whole life
constantly being negative?

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:36.540
But...

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:42.000
Generally, only having two friends
besides your girlfriend is still subpar, ya know!

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:47.250
Do you think you're going to be punished or something
since that bit of happiness cheers you up?!

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:49.200
I-I see...

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.330
I was a bit too self-conscious.

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:54.040
As long as you understand that...

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:58.870
Mentally
Delusional
Tsutsui
up until now

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:58.870
4.5 seconds

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.410
Thank you, Ezomichi!

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:05.330
Tsutsun, sorry I'm late.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:07.080
The extra lesson just dragged on...

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.250
I don't hate waiting, so don't worry about it.

00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:12.790
But you were alone for more than an hour...

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:16.540
It's nice to know that someone will come if I wait.

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:20.750
Hey, you're making a face
like an abandoned puppy, you know.

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:25.000
But still, I hate that I'm stupid.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.910
But that's okay if you excel at other things, right?

00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:32.330
Tsutsun, I want you to teach me.

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:36.790
S-sure... If it's something I can do...

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:19.750
EPISODE 4

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:19.750
"ABOUT MY DARK TIMES"

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:20.700
Well, I'm bad at math, so this right here...

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:25.120
Are you listening, Tsutsun?

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:27.750
Uh, yeah!

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:30.790
Well, I don't understand the meaning of the question
for this problem here.

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:31.620
Yeah.

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:34.330
Well, I don't understand the meaning of the question
for this problem here.

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:35.080
Huh?!

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:38.290
You don't understand the problem itself, huh?

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:40.500
That's serious.

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:41.540
Yeah...

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:45.910
Well, that's a surprising thing that you're bad at.

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:51.910
I'm a bit infatuated...

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:51.120
I'm a bit infatuated...

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:54.950
The point of this question certainly is hard to grasp,

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:57.790
but you round the decimal off to the first digit...

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:58.660
Okay.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:03:59.870
Then take the integer...

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:01.250
Okay.

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:03.120
She's pursing her lips...

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:06.580
Tsutsun?

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:08.620
Do you even want to teach me?

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:10.450
I do! I do, but...

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:12.750
Next time, we should get Ito and
have all three of us here after all.

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:18.580
Wait...

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:20.660
can I come sit next to you?

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:21.620
Huh?

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.620
I can get just a little carried away.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.950
H-hey, Tsutsun.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:35.080
S-sorry! I just, uh, lost my senses there!

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:37.700
She's asking me to help her study,
so what am I doing?!

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:39.330
I'm so freakin' creepy!

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:44.040
Well, I'm gonna do something I'm not used to!
What do I do about this situation?!

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:46.500
Huh?

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.200
What's with that reaction?

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:56.250
Up till now you came on to me
in so many different ways, but still...

00:04:56.250 --> 00:05:00.120
No. It was sudden, so it was a bit...

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:13.250
What the heck is up with you?

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:17.200
What do I do? I'm feeling kind of...

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:18.790
What should I do?!

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:22.540
There's no sign that Ma will come in today, either...

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:24.000
Go for it! At least give her a kiss!

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:26.000
No way... No way, no way!
Go for it! At least give her a kiss!

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.000
Don't just be sneaky!

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:31.250
If you're gonna come in, be bold and burst inside!

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:36.830
Hey, is he really that Tsutsui guy?

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:40.120
He probably is. He's a well-known otaku.

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:42.500
And he's reading a game strategy guide.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.200
I can't believe it.

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:47.540
Igarashi would actually date a guy like that?

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.250
He doesn't measure up to me.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.370
What is this?

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:58.870
To Hikari Tsutsui
I'll be waiting for you
after school at the gym

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:58.660
I only have bad feelings about whatever
something like this will bring to me!

00:05:58.910 --> 00:06:01.870
Only bad feelings!

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:03.790
Morning, Tsutsui!

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:06.080
Uh, what's this? A love letter, huh?!

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:08.870
Well aren't you surprisingly popular with the ladies!

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:11.330
Yeah, right! Use some common sense!

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:15.120
For me the turn out for something like this
will 100% be a trap!

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:18.000
Oh man, he really came!

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:19.040
So gross!

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:21.000
You don't know that, do you?!

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.830
You actually have a cute girlfriend who likes you!

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:26.040
What are you doing thinking so negatively?!

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:28.500
What are you gonna do if it's a real love letter?

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:30.750
Do you wanna just leave her waiting in vain?

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:34.410
I see. That would be harsh, huh...

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:36.500
I mean, if the person is there, though.

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:40.410
I knew it was a trap!

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:43.620
But I didn't think of this turn out.

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:46.450
Am I going to be beat up?

00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:50.120
Are you really going out with Igarashi?

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:52.830
Yes.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.040
Why?

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:55.790
Have you got some sort of dirt on her or something?

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:58.790
You think I'd do something so despicable?!
That's disgraceful!

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:02.540
Then why is Igarashi dating someone like you?

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:03.870
What do you mean, "why"?

00:07:03.870 --> 00:07:05.910
Should I start with the beginning of the romance?

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:07.870
That's not what I mean!

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:09.370
Man, you're slow.

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:13.330
I'm in love with your girlfriend.

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:15.330
I'm telling you to give her to me.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:16.290
Wha-?

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:18.160
There's no way I could do tha-

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:24.540
What do you have that I don't?

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:28.330
Nothing... but...

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:29.120
No.

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:32.330
Do you think you're a good match for her?

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:36.000
I've never thought that. Not once.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:36.910
But...

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:41.540
Are you understanding what I'm saying?

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:46.500
You've always gotten your way
no matter what, haven't you?

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:47.370
What?

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:50.580
You're good-looking, popular,
and have confidence in yourself.

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:52.410
And it looks like you have a lot of friends, too.

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:55.750
That's why you think that with intimidation
and power you can get whatever you want.

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:58.500
You're the type of person I hate the most.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:06.160
And there you have it. Dammit.

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:10.700
No matter how absurd it is,
I'm the one who's gonna lose.

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:13.200
It's always been like that.

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:16.950
I was always thinking it's fine if it ends like this.

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:21.410
Ordinarily, that would've been okay, but...

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:27.950
Huh? Tsutsui, do you have a cold?

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:29.000
Yeah...

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:32.450
I'm going to leave early today,
so I came to tell you that.

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:33.910
O-okay...

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:38.870
Shit...

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:43.200
That guy... Is he going to approach her?

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:44.370
But...

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:49.870
Even if she's hit on by another guy,
is there any sort of guarantee that she'd pick me?

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:57.620
Just how much does she like me right now, I wonder?

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:57.620
Just how much does she like me right now, I wonder?

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:06.160
Tsutsui, who is once more contemplating life at the park
where he often hid during his dark period.

00:08:58.580 --> 00:09:01.290
After all, I'm just an otaku.

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:05.450
I feel so sorry for her
with someone like me as her boyfriend.

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:11.160
What's wrong, little girl? Are you lost?

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.040
Uh, no.

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:16.700
When I saw you I thought that might be the case,
but I'm not interested in that...

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:18.450
Did something happen?

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:23.250
I-I don't know where my brother is...

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:25.120
Do you remember where you were before?

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:26.120
No.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.500
Can you tell me your address?

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.450
No.

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:30.450
Uh... Then let's go to the police...

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:31.620
No!

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:37.120
Gonna let Mom
handle this

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:37.160
Want to come to my house?
I have a little brother about the same age as you.

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:38.040
Huh?

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:39.290
Anzu!

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:40.870
Big brother!

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:42.620
So this is where you were, Anzu-

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:46.790
You!

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:49.330
What the hell are you doing with my little sister?!

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.500
I wasn't doing anything...

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:52.290
Big Brother!

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:53.410
Idiot!

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:55.750
Didn't I tell you to wait in front
of the convenience store?

00:09:55.750 --> 00:10:00.000
Getting caught by this otaku, of all people...
There's no telling what he'd do to you!

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:03.370
It's loathsome when the otaku system is misunderstood!

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:04.910
I am not a lolicon!

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:05.620
Huh?

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:07.040
Generally, you bastards are the idiots!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.370
Of all things, I can't believe
you'd leave a little child unattended!

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:13.870
Should I take an hour and tell you about
the horrors of a real lolicon?!

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.080
Shut up! What the hell is wrong with you?!

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:17.700
Let's go, Anzu.

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:20.660
We're getting away from this otaku
as fast as possible!

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:22.870
H-hey. Wait a second!

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:24.950
What do you want?

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:29.290
What are you going to do about... her?

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:32.290
You already know. I'm gonna take her from you.

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:35.950
It's obvious, but I'm not going to lose to you.

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:40.620
You look like you're gonna cry...

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:42.660
Well, what are you gonna do, otaku?

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:46.830
There's not really much that I can do.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:52.660
I can put a picture of your face along with a whole
lot of lies on the 'net and socially destroy you,

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:53.660
is about all I can do.

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:55.620
You jerk! I'll freakin' kill you!

00:10:57.580 --> 00:10:59.000
Anzu, scream!

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:00.120
Huh?

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:01.660
Anything is okay, just hurry!

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:06.700
What's wrong?!

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:07.330
Huh?

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:10.910
Officer, over here! This guy was with my sister!

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:11.580
What?!

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:13.700
Huh?!
What are you doing?!

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:18.250
I'm going to call your house,
so I'll have you talk to them too.

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:21.160
What an idiot. I will obliterate you!
Mommy, what's that?

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:21.540
What an idiot. I will obliterate you!

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.000
What the hell is he doing?

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:28.790
Dammit...

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:33.330
Yesterday those guys let me go in the end
since there was no proof,

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:35.370
and it was over after they gave me a verbal warning,

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:38.410
but that made my mom cry, man!

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:40.540
Hey, look...

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:41.410
Huh?

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:44.580
Huh?

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:45.620
No way!

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:46.620
He's here.

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:48.790
You shouldn't come to school, lolicon.

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:51.870
I know this.

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:55.540
I know this, this atmosphere is very déjà vu...

00:11:57.000 --> 00:12:00.290
That guy sure is something. So he'd go this far.

00:11:58.580 --> 00:12:00.450
Attempted Kidnapping a Little Girl
Hikari Tsutsui

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:03.870
My dark times...

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.620
He really is gross.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.910
I can't believe he tried to tell a small kid
to come with him.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.580
Of course he stays away from us.

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:15.750
Now he's more scary than gross... For real though!

00:12:15.910 --> 00:12:19.000
What is this? I can't believe they're saying I'm a lolicon...

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.330
That's such a believable lie, I can't defend myself.

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:24.580
No... Even if I defended myself,
they wouldn't believe me.

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:30.120
I've never been able to properly communicate with
people, so there'd be no trust in me from the start.

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:33.200
Ah, this brings me back...

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:36.370
This cold gaze that everyone looks at me with.

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:39.700
Also, I'll be treated like I'm poisonous from now on.

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:49.160
Tsutsun.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.540
Don't come near me for a while.

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:54.660
Why not?

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:57.250
You heard the rumors, right?

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:02.080
Now, you're the girlfriend of a lolicon.
It'll affect your reputation.

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:05.290
I really don't care if you're a lolicon.

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:10.120
You probably mean to support me, but... I'm not.

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:12.000
That was a joke.

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:14.950
There's no way I could believe those rumors.

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:16.950
You don't do that sort of thing.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.080
You shouldn't come near me after all.

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:22.950
But...

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:23.910
Bonk.

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:25.540
See ya.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:37.450
It's honestly way too pitiful for her
to see this part of me.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:40.160
Tsutsui.

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:45.250
Don't force yourself either.
There are a lot of things you hate talking about.

00:13:45.910 --> 00:13:47.290
What are you saying?!

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:51.580
I believe you, Tsutsui!
That's why I don't care what anyone says!

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:53.500
Ito.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:57.660
Oh, Ishino.

00:13:57.660 --> 00:14:01.250
I am disappointed in you, Tsutsui.
You really are gross.

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:10.450
I think the best thing about Ishino is her honesty.

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:13.950
But she looked at me like I was garbage just now...

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:14.790
So gross.

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:15.370
He's a lolicon...

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:15.950
No point in going to college.
He's a lolicon...

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:16.790
No point in going to college.

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:22.450
But me being suspected of kidnapping
a young girl in high school

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:26.290
and why they teased me in junior high
are completely different things.

00:14:27.160 --> 00:14:28.120
Hey!

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:31.750
Why are you sitting there looking like everything's okay?

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:34.500
All the girls are scared, you know.

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:36.790
This really isn't funny.

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:47.160
Inbox
Hikari Tsutsui

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:47.160
No Subject

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:46.870
Let's go home separately for a while.

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:53.870
Igarashi.

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:56.040
Uh, I-

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.200
He's enough.

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:00.370
Huh? Uh, wait! I still haven't...

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:03.080
Wait! At least let me just talk to you!

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:08.000
Will you please let me go?

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:10.450
No way...

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:13.500
I can't believe she won't even listen to me...

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:16.500
You mean to say you like that otaku that much?!

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:20.750
I've been telling you that, right?
He alone is enough for me.

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:22.080
I can't understand that!

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:24.450
What's so good about that lolicon otaku?

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:28.700
It's not necessary for me
to have your understanding on that.

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:31.910
I won't forgive someone
who spreads irresponsible rumors.

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:40.750
Not only was I snubbed... I was shunned?

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.120
I lost to that otaku?

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:44.330
Holy crap!

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:53.450
Kaoru!

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:05.410
What's wrong? You look down today!

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:08.000
My life is over.

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:09.250
Huh?

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:13.080
I really have a brother... who's a criminal!

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:20.450
I worked hard in my studies and class ranking,
and even in getting popular, and yet...

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:22.200
It's all over.

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:25.450
Huh? What happened, Kaoru?!

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:27.950
I can't say what it is.

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:31.910
It's okay! I'll always be on your side, Kaoru!

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:34.540
Anzu...

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:37.120
Talk to me, Kaoru!

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:39.830
Actually...

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:42.750
I'm home.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:46.870
You were gloomy, but such a kind child.

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:48.290
Don't talk about me in the past-tense!

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:51.540
I told you. Just like I explained yesterday,
that was a misunderstanding.

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:52.910
Was it, though?!

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:54.790
I can only go with what makes sense!

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:59.290
Ah, you're already done for! You're gonna be a NEET!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:04.660
Well, right now, I can't do anything
about home or school.

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:08.250
I can only endure with my enhanced ignoring skills.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:11.870
Contacts
A
Iroha Igarashi
Arisa Ishino

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:11.870
Yuto Ito
Kazuhisa Ueda
Daisuke Eguchi

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:18.870
It's probably really shameless of me to think
that I want her to be with me when I'm like this.

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:21.540
But...

00:17:27.120 --> 00:17:28.410
Hello?

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:31.080
You surprised me.

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:33.080
I can't believe I'm getting a phone call from you.

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:36.080
Was today okay for you?

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:39.000
You don't need to worry about that sort of thing.

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:42.200
I'm sure I've said this,
but I'm totally use to these things.

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:46.870
At any rate, they can crush my spirit at will.

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:49.500
Even if they crush it like an egg, I'll be fine.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:50.910
What do you mean?

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.120
I was just thinking.

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:56.540
I've been this type of person since way back when.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:18:00.370
To say the least, I was not a person
that was liked by others.

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:02.160
That's
why...

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:01.910
That's why...

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:08.160
There's absolutely no need for you
to be dating someone like me.

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:14.040
There are so many other guys that are great,
and pretty much all of them are better guys than I am.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:15.290
Tsutsun.

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:17.700
I won't let you say anything else.

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:22.660
The person that I like...

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:28.450
is nicer than anyone else, cares about his friends,
and he's awkward but loving.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:31.540
He's the best guy in the world.

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:35.790
If you're saying you're no good
because of who you are,

00:18:35.790 --> 00:18:38.620
then say "This is how I am, so come with me."

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:45.290
If you like me, don't say that and stand alone.
Just bring me along with you.

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:51.000
Dammit.

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:53.660
Even more than being called "gross"
a hundred times...

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:56.910
acknowledging to myself that those words were said...

00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:01.290
How does my chest hurt so much?

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.950
You just don't learn, do you? Don't come to school!

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:13.080
We're telling you you're gross!

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:18.450
He's the best guy in the world.

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.540
The hell are you laughing at?!

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:23.660
Sorry! It's nothing.

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:27.500
Crap. I have to make an effort or my face will...

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:30.870
Ew, he's laughing by himself.

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:32.120
He's seriously gross.

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:33.830
And he laughs gross, too.

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:38.660
What? You won't walk home with me?

00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:41.160
Not until everything blows over.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:42.450
Oh, come on...

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:44.700
I'm sorry. Bye.

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:52.580
He's so stubborn.

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:04.040
Are you okay?

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:07.080
Thanks! You're so pretty, miss!

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:11.790
Miss, do you go to this high school?

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:13.000
Yes, I do.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:17.290
Miss, where's Mitsuya Takanashi from Year 3 Class D?

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:20.290
Um, Class D? I wonder if they're still here?

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:23.330
Igarashi and... Anzu?

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:24.620
Big Brother!

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:27.080
Huh? What's with this pairing?

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:30.330
So you're her brother, huh?

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:34.290
This lady helped me when I fell!

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:37.250
Well, thank you for taking care of my sister!

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:39.330
I didn't really do anything.

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:40.750
Please let me go.

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:43.160
But more importantly, Big Brother!

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:45.540
What, Anzu? Now is not the time!

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:47.250
Well then, I'll be leaving now.

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:48.580
Wait, Igarashi!

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:50.830
Hey, listen to me!

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:52.950
Jeez! What, Anzu?!

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:58.910
That guy that the officer took away the other day!
That was Kaoru's big brother!

00:20:59.080 --> 00:20:59.950
Huh?

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:05.750
Kaoru's been feeling down the whole time!
He doesn't eat lunch either!

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:07.870
It's all because I yelled!

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:10.580
It's because you told me to yell!

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:14.120
What do I do? What should I do?!
